From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:00:34 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Startup inside a UWP app: bootstrap, profile, one process

XRE started by the shell rather than by firefox.exe, the profile in the
app's LocalState, no content processes, and the browser UI pieces that
assumed either.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
